# (0.25) The folder disk after a restart of Horizon (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes
# tests/desk25.keys from this; the card gets tests/mk23.py's additions and an /atari.ini that
# says "folder=/Atari", "folderdrive=2", as the I/O processor writes it when the folder disk is
# mounted: emu816 does not write it). Shots (s):
#   1  the folder disk mounted from the panel: D2: "/Atari (folder)", Refresh
#   2  Horizon restarted (Shut down, Restart), the panel again: the kernel no longer knows the
#      folder, the Desktop takes it from /atari.ini: "/Atari (folder)", Refresh not dimmed
# (the pointer: the new kernel starts it at the centre: moved to the corner first)
#   3  Refresh clicked (mounted again: the second CLASSIC_MOUNT kind 5 in the log)
